{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f4c023f7-231c-8b8f-b43c-a8456eab98f9",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T10:39:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Susan Gardiner",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:36:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. [pause] Sorry, I'm going to talk quiet. I've got a baby asleep in the next room."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:36:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, take your time. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:36:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My recycling bin didn't get emptied. It's sitting at the curb with a tag on it. The tag says rejected."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is this for pickup today, or was it last week?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last week. Thursday. I put it out Wednesday night like always. Still there this morning with the tag on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:37:15-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And what's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:37:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "408 Dixon Street. North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:37:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Do you remember what the tag said besides rejected? Sometimes the driver checks a box or writes a reason."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hang on. [pause] I'm going to step out to the porch. Okay, I can read it from the window. There's a box checked. It says contaminated. Something about bags."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah. That usually means there were plastic bags inside, or food waste, or something that doesn't belong. Recyclables are supposed to go in loose, not bagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:37:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was loose. Mostly. There was one bag of shredded paper. That's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Shredded paper in a bag, that'll do it, unfortunately. It jams the sorting equipment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm the landlord. I rent the downstairs. I don't know what the tenant puts in there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Might be worth a quick word with them about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Is there a fee for this? For the rejection?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, there's no fee for a rejected bin. They just leave it and the tag. You take out whatever doesn't belong and put it out again next pickup."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Next pickup is Thursday. So it sits for another week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, they won't come back before then. And I know last weekend's nor'easter didn't help, with everything buried and delayed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The storm wasn't why it was rejected. The tag says bags."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're right, that's a separate thing. I'm just saying the schedule's been a little off for everybody this week, so check that Thursday is still your day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's been Thursday for three years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:38:59-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then it should be Thursday. I can note on your address that you called and that the bin's being corrected. That way if there's a question, it's on record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:39:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:39:12-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Done. And the bin can stay at the curb if you'd rather fix it there. Just pull the bag out and make sure everything's loose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:39:22-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll take the bag out today. It's a lot of fuss over one bag of paper."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Shredded paper can go in a paper bag, though, if you want to keep it contained. Just not plastic."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Paper bag. Okay. Good to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:39:41-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:39:44-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. That's it. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Gardiner. Hope the little one sleeps a good while."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T10:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Me too. Bye."
    }
  ],
